#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:54
msgid "How A10 Integration Works"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:56
msgid ""
"When an Instance is added to an A10 load balancer, |morpheus| performs "
"the following operations via the A10 aXAPI:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Server Creation** — For each container in the instance, a server object"
" is created on the A10 with the container's IP address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Service Group Creation** — A service group is created containing all "
"the servers and their designated ports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:60
msgid ""
"**HTTP Template Update** — The virtual server's HTTP template is updated "
"with host-based routing rules that direct traffic to the correct service "
"group based on the instance's hostname."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:61
msgid ""
"**SSL Configuration** — If SSL is configured for the instance, "
"certificates and keys are uploaded to the A10 and bound to the virtual "
"server port 443."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:64
msgid "Removing an Instance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:66
msgid ""
"When an instance is removed from the A10 load balancer, |morpheus| "
"reverses the operations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:68
msgid "Removes host routing entries from the HTTP template"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:69
msgid "Deletes the service group"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:70
msgid "Removes individual server registrations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:73
msgid "Virtual Servers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:75
msgid ""
"A10 virtual servers are automatically created when the load balancer "
"integration is initialized. The virtual server is configured with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:77
msgid "The VIP address and port specified during integration setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:78
msgid "An HTTP template for host-based routing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:79
msgid "Ports 80 and 443 with the routing template applied"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:82
msgid "SSL Certificate Management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:84
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can automatically manage SSL certificates on A10 load "
"balancers:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:86
msgid "Certificates are uploaded as PEM files via the aXAPI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:87
msgid "Private keys are uploaded separately"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:88
msgid "Certificate bindings are applied to port 443 on the virtual server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:89
msgid "When instances are removed, their associated certificates are cleaned up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:91
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:91
msgid ""
"The A10 integration uses the aXAPI v3 interface. Ensure the A10 device is"
" running ACOS 4.x or later for full compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:94
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:96
msgid ""
"**Connection errors** — Verify the API Host and Port are reachable from "
"the |morpheus| appliance and that the management interface is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Authentication failures** — Confirm the credentials have administrative"
" (or at minimum, read/write) API access on the A10 device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/loadbalancers/a10.rst:98
msgid ""
"**SSL upload failures** — Ensure the certificate and key are in valid PEM"
" format."
msgstr ""

